When you're already carrying a lot of stuff, and you move to a square with 
stuff on it, you are told (something like):

"There is a <whatever> here, but you can't lift any more."

But lifting things is primarily related to how many free inventory slots you 
have, and not what they weigh. Quite often, you get this message when you 
could lift more things, but not *this particular thing* (e.g. a corpse).

Wouldn't it make more sense to say: "There is a <whatever> here, but you 
can't lift it." ?

